    "Friends see your name, goal and daily totals, read-only. It is stored in your own iCloud and shared through Apple; this app has no servers. Your friends also need the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus amigos ven tu nombre, tu meta y tus totales diarios, solo lectura. Se guarda en tu propio iCloud y se comparte a través de Apple; esta app no tiene servidores. Tus amigos también necesitan la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends uses your own iCloud to share. Sign in to iCloud in the Settings app to use it." : {
      "localizations" : {
